{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "locale": "zh-CN",
  "scenario_id": "1_x_047shu_2_1_2_047_12",
  "source_raw_hash": "sha256:fee978fd4e745c1fa39dc9c02dda57f1b399802858b062e501858b7887bade61",
  "entries": {
    "story-text:v1:1_x_047shu_2_1_2_047_12:1_2_047_12_a:cmd-000000:title:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:8e784afc64d81f91dcfc52cf7e2551015d0d50515c1abbecfe6e51d562d98d41",
      "text": "放学后的家庭影院",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_x_047shu_2_1_2_047_12:1_2_047_12_a:cmd-000000:synopsis:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:2a46a0c0b4a3ef8547545114c5f4b4161bac122d74e709099cf208021d5b37ec",
      "text": "在学校被同班同学庆祝了生日，\n秀却总觉得和他们有些距离感，\n并为人际交往的方法而苦恼。\n另一边在C.FIRST的生日派对上，\n两人送上了意想不到的惊喜……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_x_047shu_2_1_2_047_12:1_2_047_12_a:cmd-000022:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:270f4e00e510d078dbe1f2d248f760ba5520af0b6743349822517503b5d14431",
      "text": "嗯。派对的流程我觉得这样就好。\n天峰君要是能高兴就好了呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_x_047shu_2_1_2_047_12:1_2_047_12_a:cmd-000031:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:b9353c4570bf565db468e36391715750ddca2815d8906854a49762ad2aa37767",
      "text": "百百人的意见，总是能帮上大忙啊。\n今后也请不要客气，畅所欲言吧。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_x_047shu_2_1_2_047_12:1_2_047_12_a:cmd-000037:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:3eb6c2d4794e88b8002301cbb5f98ebec12648819c5262fd5c46fc9f1408e2e7",
      "text": "……这么说的眉见君，\n有把想到的事情，好好说出来吗？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_x_047shu_2_1_2_047_12:1_2_047_12_a:cmd-000044:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:fa2ee46ad64834d2c10d8fb28c5bfdca8257dab1d38975343276cece893ade50",
      "text": "我……\n只要是我判断有必要的事，自认都已经传达了。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_x_047shu_2_1_2_047_12:1_2_047_12_a:cmd-000050:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:b7be9827a9419dc24fb1b9d5487daf69df32aab87c1168001ac198fae2c888f9",
      "text": "这样啊。但是，实际上……\n我们应该还有更多能说出口的心里话吧。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_x_047shu_2_1_2_047_12:1_2_047_12_b:cmd-000024:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:b32f9922f1f192983cf9d4224237511dc7d3b17049272fdd2af8c24d1bd9a51d",
      "text": "天峰君，真的很率直呢。\n率直到让人有点吃不消的程度。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_x_047shu_2_1_2_047_12:1_2_047_12_b:cmd-000031:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:e2ec813380f023fdcd4a7602dec7cae047aa02d35a6243e9c4fc95b81d3a0e96",
      "text": "诶……不，\n就算是这种意见也没关系。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_x_047shu_2_1_2_047_12:1_2_047_12_b:cmd-000038:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:35ba7ae00257a62c9b718f58fc1de517a02d0039c33a125681a38c6bd8397ec2",
      "text": "请让我听听，\n百百人学长最真实的心声吧。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_x_047shu_2_1_2_047_12:1_2_047_12_b:cmd-000046:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:d18759569030cbe1b08d6937d7a628adcf2ba15cb97f71e1da23e94953cbde4f",
      "text": "我并不擅长这种事。\n……不过，我会努力的。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_x_047shu_2_1_2_047_12:1_2_047_12_b:cmd-000056:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:63109f3d750500791223aa66a44561112faa91d50e82c5f21df4ab54827b1e67",
      "text": "因为我觉得为了实现我们C.FIRST的梦想，\n这是必不可少的。所以请千万别跟我客气。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_x_047shu_2_1_2_047_12:1_2_047_12_c:cmd-000019:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:39e163d250d9f437c748d2bd8b67122f8f1a71eaaddf162aac458a24f67831ab",
      "text": "第一次工作的时候，锐心学长不是也\n询问过我们两人的意见吗。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_x_047shu_2_1_2_047_12:1_2_047_12_c:cmd-000025:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:1f372a3e66a5f81e24da72f7fe07c2ebc4c14df172d44652f86e01051e326bd2",
      "text": "因为我想起了那时的经历，\n所以这次我也能主动向学长们挑起话题了。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_x_047shu_2_1_2_047_12:1_2_047_12_c:cmd-000032:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:216e46d3ab13593c12c4386eaa8ef146588c3eaf81f34b959e6e2f94d8c92a38",
      "text": "这样啊。如果这对作为后辈、\n同时也是同伴的秀的成长有所助益，那就再好不过了。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_x_047shu_2_1_2_047_12:1_2_047_12_c:cmd-000039:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:3de3246557d9bd22e487a2a97ccdaaf2af11d8a42ab652f7387e4c14ac7bcb6f",
      "text": "今后也让我们相互磨练，共同进步吧。\n……不。比起谈论这些……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_x_047shu_2_1_2_047_12:1_2_047_12_c:cmd-000048:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:d38d975dd8bacbfd311d98e0fb05acab4dced1978e66412c3b1f34228c48126f",
      "text": "再次祝你生日快乐，秀。\n愿你在接下来的一年里多福多喜。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_x_047shu_2_1_2_047_12:1_2_047_12_c:cmd-000058:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:2ea4f20e37dd0699f333c9f5ce66f97226695f1273af863f25db223d650c9423",
      "text": "谢谢学长。只要有315 Production和\n学长们在，肯定会是充实的一年。",
      "status": "draft"
    }
  }
}
